From 22ffaea39b63f72010ffdc5b474e22e8a9be580c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: caoanhhao <caoanhhao@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:56:31 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] venus: emulate ASTC LDR when the renderer lacks it

Desktop NVIDIA exposes no ASTC (or ETC2) in Vulkan, while Android games
ship ASTC-only assets: Delta Force (UE4, Android_ASTC paks) fails to load
every texture and its RenderThread crashes on the null resources.

When the renderer lacks textureCompressionASTC_LDR, advertise it and:
- report ASTC formats as sampled/transfer-only, from the RGBA8 properties;
- create ASTC images and views as R8G8B8A8_UNORM/SRGB on the renderer;
- hide the feature from the renderer in vkCreateDevice;
- decode buffer-to-image copies on the CPU at record time
  (_mesa_unpack_astc_2d_ldr) into a per-command-buffer staging buffer.

VN_DEBUG=no_astc_emu turns it off.

